# The vertical cut, for Shorts / Reels / TikTok. Recorded at 72x52 so it fills a
# 9:16 frame natively rather than being letterboxed into one.
#
# Paced a little slower than the landscape cuts: on a phone the viewer is
# reading a small frame, and there is no scrubbing back.
wait 0.5
type casm list -n 6
enter
wait 5
type casm containerize 7c1d9a02
enter
wait 6
type y
enter
# creating the container - the progress lines carry this stretch
wait 15
type casm resume 7c1d9a02
enter
# claude comes up in bypass mode, filling the tall frame
wait 8
